      <div><b>03</b><span>Open-ended social action</span><strong>39.4 <i>→</i> 73.9</strong><small>STSS · six interaction domains</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="evidence-key"><strong>Cross-model reinforcement</strong><span><i></i>Base model</span><span><i></i>+ MetaMind</span></div>
    <div class="evidence-bars" aria-label="Cross-model ToMBench comparisons">
